Subject: media: i2c: imx708: add the 2x2 binned mode

Add the 2304x1296 mode of the Raspberry Pi downstream driver. The sensor
sums each 2x2 group of same-colour pixels. The mode reads out at up to
56 fps. The full mode reaches 14.35 fps.

Both modes read the whole active area. set_fmt selects the mode nearest
to the requested size. A mode change recomputes the PLL and updates
PIXEL_RATE, HBLANK, VBLANK and EXPOSURE. The register values come from
the downstream driver.
---
